# Wrap-Up

<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; background: #f7f8fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto;">

  <div>
    <h4 style="margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;">In this professional learning module, you learned how to:</h4>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 10px; font-size: 14pt">
      <li>Prepare to teach how AI generates responses by modeling the iterative cycle of prompting, testing, analyzing, and refining AI-generated outputs.</li><br>
      <li>Guide students in developing strong prompting and evaluation skills to critically assess and improve AI-generated content.</li><br>
      <li>Support students in exploring AI’s role in creativity, forecasting, and decision-making through hands-on activities and real-world examples.</li><br>
      <li>Lead students in designing and testing AI-assisted solutions to authentic challenges, emphasizing responsible use and effective problem-solving practices.</li><br>
      <li>Lead students in designing and testing AI-assisted solutions to authentic challenges, emphasizing responsible use and effective problem-solving practices.</li>
